# A statement about a triple term whose subject is a blank node (RDF 1.2
# Turtle §2.8): a query cannot name that node, so the rendering tests expect
# the term to be refused as a pattern position.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix foaf: <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .

ex:blankNaming rdf:reifies <<( _:b1 foaf:name ex:a )>> .
